          "$ref": "#/definitions/EvaluationOpsUserInfo"
        },
        "updated_by": {
          "description": "**参数解释:**\n最后一次更新该资源的用户简要信息。\n**取值范围:**\n符合EvaluationOpsUserInfo结构定义的对象。",
          "$ref": "#/definitions/EvaluationOpsUserInfo"
        }
